{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13238","headline":"刘侍御朝命许停官归侍 · 皇甫冉","name":"刘侍御朝命许停官归侍","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"孟孙唯问孝，莱子复辞官。\n幸遂温凊愿，其甘稼穑难。\n采芝供上药，拾槿奉晨餐。\n栋里云藏雨，山中暑带寒。\n非时应有笋，闲地尽生兰。\n赐告承优诏，长筵永日欢。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皇甫冉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13238.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13238","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}